WEBVTT

00:02.186 --> 00:08.659
**
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

00:08.659 --> 00:12.263
[engine humming]
[发动机嗡嗡声]

00:12.263 --> 00:14.765
- ONCE AROUND THE ROUNDABOUT.
- 绕过环形交叉口后。

00:14.765 --> 00:17.000
[tires screech]
[轮胎尖叫声]

00:17.000 --> 00:18.269
LEFT AT THE WALL.
留在墙上。

00:18.269 --> 00:20.837
[tires screech]
[轮胎尖叫声]

00:20.837 --> 00:24.941
OVER THE "BUMP OF TRUTH."
越过“真相的冲击”。

00:24.941 --> 00:28.912
AND, FINALLY,
THE FLAMING HOOP!
最后，
燃烧的圆圈！

00:28.912 --> 00:31.815
[tires screech]
[轮胎尖叫声]

00:31.815 --> 00:33.284
[tires screech]
[轮胎尖叫声]

00:33.284 --> 00:34.851
THANK YOU, MRS. PUFF.
谢谢您，夫人。噗。

00:34.851 --> 00:37.221
I AM NOW A CARD-CARRYING DRIVER
我现在是持卡司机

00:37.221 --> 00:39.923
AND A PRODUCTIVE MEMBER
OF SOCIETY.
和一位富有成效的成员
社会的。

00:39.923 --> 00:43.194
WHOO-HOO! YEAH!
呼呼！是的！

00:43.194 --> 00:46.930
- OH, NOTHING GIVES ME MORE JOY
THAN TEACHING.
- 哦，没有什么比这更让我快乐的了
比教学。

00:46.930 --> 00:49.666
I CAN'T WAIT
TO PASS MY NEXT STUDENT.
我等不及了
通过我的下一个学生。

00:49.666 --> 00:51.802
- HELLO, MRS. PUFF!
- 你好，夫人。噗！

00:51.802 --> 00:54.505
I'M ALL SET
FOR MY DRIVING TEST.
我已经准备好了
为了我的驾驶考试。

00:54.505 --> 00:56.240
[shivering with fear]
[恐惧得发抖]

00:56.240 --> 00:58.242
MRS. PUFF, YOU OKAY?
太太。泡芙，你还好吗？

00:58.242 --> 01:02.713
- JUST START DRIVING.
- 开始驾驶。

01:02.713 --> 01:06.283
[tires squealing]
[轮胎吱吱声]

01:06.283 --> 01:09.052
- TURN THIS BOAT AROUND
IMMEDIATELY!
- 转动这艘船
立即！

01:09.052 --> 01:10.287
- RIGHT AWAY, MA'AM.
- 马上，女士。

01:10.287 --> 01:11.922
[tires screeching]
[轮胎的尖叫声]

01:11.922 --> 01:14.325
DON'T WORRY, MRS. PUFF.
I HAVE THIS UNDER CONTROL.
别担心，夫人。噗。
这一切都在我的掌控之中。

01:14.325 --> 01:16.427
[grunts]
UH...
[咕哝]
呃……

01:16.427 --> 01:19.363
[tires screeching]
[轮胎的尖叫声]

01:25.969 --> 01:27.604
[monkeys screeching]
- NEXT UP...
[猴子尖叫]
- 接下来...

01:27.604 --> 01:30.574
GOIN' BANANAS 3
IN 3-D.
去香蕉 3
在 3-D 中。

01:30.574 --> 01:33.344
- HEY, DUDE.
PASS THE 3-D GLASSES.
- 嘿，伙计。
通过 3D 眼镜。

01:33.344 --> 01:35.979
THIS IS SUPPOSED TO BE,
LIKE, IN 3-D.
这应该是，
就像 3D 一样。

01:35.979 --> 01:39.516
- [chuckles]
OH, YEAH, RIGHT.
- [轻笑]
哦，是的，对。

01:39.516 --> 01:40.784
- HERE I AM.
- 我在这里。

01:40.784 --> 01:42.686
I'M COMING AT YOU...
我来找你了...

01:42.686 --> 01:45.289
[tires squeal]
LIKE YOUR WORST NIGHTMARE.
[轮胎吱吱声]
就像你最可怕的噩梦一样。

01:45.289 --> 01:48.459
[laugh evilly]
[邪恶地笑]

01:48.459 --> 01:52.696
[Hawaiian ukulele music]
[夏威夷尤克里里音乐]

01:52.696 --> 01:54.030
[laughter]
[笑声]

01:54.030 --> 01:55.799
- I THINK IT'S SAFE TO SAY
- 我认为可以肯定地说

01:55.799 --> 01:59.069
YOU HAVE ONCE AGAIN FAILED
YOUR DRIVING TEST!
你再次失败了
您的驾驶考试！

01:59.069 --> 02:01.538
[laughter]
[笑声]

02:01.538 --> 02:03.106
- UH, BUT, MRS. PUFF, I--
- NO BUTS, SPONGEBOB!
- 呃，但是，夫人。噗，我——
- 没有屁股，海绵宝宝！

02:03.106 --> 02:06.277
YOU'VE FAILED THIS TEST
OVER AND OVER.
你没有通过这次测试
一遍又一遍。

02:06.277 --> 02:09.346
I'M BEGINNING
TO BELIEVE YOU'RE SIMPLY...
我开始了
相信你只是......

02:09.346 --> 02:11.582
UNTEACHABLE.
不可教的。

02:11.582 --> 02:13.417
[laughter]
[笑声]

02:13.417 --> 02:16.387
NOW GET OUT OF MY SIGHT!
现在滚出我的视线！

02:16.387 --> 02:20.557
- AHH! GYEE! GYAH!
- 啊啊！哎呀！呀！

02:20.557 --> 02:24.628
I'M SORRY, MRS. PUFF!
对不起，夫人。噗！

02:24.628 --> 02:26.897
[sobbing]
- [growling]
[抽泣]
- [咆哮]

02:26.897 --> 02:28.765
both: DUDE!
两人：伙计！

02:28.765 --> 02:32.469
- THIS IS, LIKE,
THE GNARLIEST 3-D MOVIE EVER.
- 这就像，
有史以来最粗糙的 3D 电影。

02:32.469 --> 02:34.004
[grunts]
[咕哝]

02:34.004 --> 02:36.172
[laughter]
[笑声]

02:39.443 --> 02:41.945
IF ONLY SPONGEBOB COULD PASS
HIS BOATING TEST,
如果海绵宝宝能通过就好了
他的划船测试，

02:41.945 --> 02:44.648
HE'D BE OUT OF MY LIFE
ONCE AND FOR ALL.
他会从我的生活中消失
一劳永逸。

02:44.648 --> 02:47.751
UNFORTUNATELY,
I KEEP GETTING REMINDED
不幸的是，
我不断收到提醒

02:47.751 --> 02:49.019
OF THE CONSEQUENCES
后果

02:49.019 --> 02:51.755
IF I GET TOO ANGRY
WITH THE LITTLE NUISANCE.
如果我太生气了
没有一点麻烦。

02:51.755 --> 02:55.926
I CAN'T EVEN LEAVE TOWN
WITHOUT VIOLATING MY PAROLE.
我什至无法离开城镇
在不违反我的假释条件的情况下。

02:55.926 --> 02:57.761
OH!
哦！

02:57.761 --> 03:02.065
IF THERE WAS ONLY SOME WAY THAT
I DIDN'T HAVE TO LIVE IN FEAR.
如果有办法的话
我不必生活在恐惧之中。

03:02.065 --> 03:03.467
FEAR--
害怕 -

03:03.467 --> 03:05.101
THAT'S THE ANSWER.
这就是答案。

03:05.101 --> 03:08.405
SPONGEBOB IS AFRAID
OF THE DRIVING COURSE.
海绵宝宝害怕了
驾驶课程。

03:08.405 --> 03:11.007
SO IT WOULD STAND
TO REASON
这样就可以了
讲道理

03:11.007 --> 03:13.009
THAT IF HE TOOK
THE DRIVING TEST
如果他拿走了
驾驶考试

03:13.009 --> 03:14.978
SOMEWHERE BESIDES
THE DRIVING COURSE,
除此之外的某个地方
驾驶课程，

03:14.978 --> 03:17.748
HE WOULD PASS!
他会通过的！

03:21.352 --> 03:22.553
OF COURSE!
当然！

03:22.553 --> 03:24.588
THE ANSWER'S BEEN IN FRONT
OF ME ALL ALONG.
答案就在前面
一直都是我。

03:24.588 --> 03:27.023
I'LL TEST SPONGEBOB
ON A REAL ROAD,
我要测试海绵宝宝
在真正的道路上，

03:27.023 --> 03:30.160
AND THEN HE'LL BE OUT
OF MY LIFE FOREVER!
然后他就会出局
我的生命永远！

03:30.160 --> 03:31.862
[laughs]
[笑]

03:31.862 --> 03:34.865
WHAT COULD POSSIBLY
GO WRONG?
可能发生什么
出错了？

03:34.865 --> 03:39.035
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

03:39.035 --> 03:40.236
- [meows]
- [喵]

03:40.236 --> 03:41.672
- NOT NOW, GARY.
- 现在不行，加里。

03:41.672 --> 03:44.475
CAN'T YOU SEE I'M WALLOWING
IN MY OWN FILTH?
你没看到我在打滚吗
在我自己的污秽中？

03:44.475 --> 03:47.210
[groans]
[呻吟]

03:47.210 --> 03:48.178
[knock on door]
[敲门]

03:48.178 --> 03:51.247
COME BACK LATER.
I'M WALLOWING.
稍后回来。
我正在打滚。

03:51.247 --> 03:52.248
[knock on door]
[敲门]

03:52.248 --> 03:55.118
[groans]
[呻吟]

03:55.118 --> 03:56.553
[door hinge squeaks]
[门铰链吱吱作响]

03:56.553 --> 03:58.054
- GOOD MORNING, SPONGEBOB.
- 早上好，海绵宝宝。

03:58.054 --> 03:59.055
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

03:59.055 --> 04:00.891
- SPONGEBOB?
- 海绵宝宝？

04:00.891 --> 04:03.026
SPONGEBOB?
- [coughs]
海绵宝宝？
- [咳嗽]

04:03.026 --> 04:04.495
- SPONGEBOB.
- 海绵宝宝。

04:04.495 --> 04:05.896
- I'M SORRY MRS. PUFF.
- 对不起，夫人。噗。

04:05.896 --> 04:07.664
I AM TRYING
TO STAY OUT OF YOUR SIGHT.
我正在努力
远离您的视线。

04:07.664 --> 04:08.899
- [laughs]
OH, THAT.
- [笑]
哦，那个。

04:08.899 --> 04:10.667
LET'S FORGET WHAT I SAID.
让我们忘记我说过的话吧。

04:10.667 --> 04:12.969
IT'S TIME
TO TAKE A FRESH APPROACH.
是时候了
采取新的方法。

04:12.969 --> 04:14.571
- MRS. PUFF, I--
YOU SAID--
- 太太。噗，我——
你说——

04:14.571 --> 04:15.939
DON'T YOU REMEMBER?
你不记得了吗？

04:15.939 --> 04:17.608
I'M A--
我是一个——

04:17.608 --> 04:19.576
- WE DON'T HAVE TIME
FOR THIS, SPONGEBOB.
- 我们没有时间
为此，海绵宝宝。

04:19.576 --> 04:24.147
WE HAVE A LONG DAY OF DRIVING
AHEAD OF US.
我们有一整天的驾驶时间
领先于我们。

04:24.147 --> 04:27.851
[tense string orchestra music]
[紧张的弦乐]

04:27.851 --> 04:30.153
[crow-like cawing]
[乌鸦般的叫声]

04:30.153 --> 04:32.856
- MRS. PUFF,
WHY HAVE YOU TAKEN ME
- 太太。噗噗，
你为什么要带走我

04:32.856 --> 04:35.726
TO THIS RATHER REMOTE
AND SLIGHTLY SCARY LANDSCAPE?
到这个相当遥远的地方
和有点可怕的风景？

04:35.726 --> 04:39.630
- TO OVERCOME
YOUR FEARS, SILLY.
- 克服
你的恐惧，傻瓜。

04:39.630 --> 04:41.031
- [groans]
[bones jingle]
- [呻吟]
[骨头叮当声]

04:41.031 --> 04:42.599
- IT'S NOT WORKING.
- 它不起作用。

04:42.599 --> 04:45.436
- HERE WE ARE.
- 我们在这里。

04:45.436 --> 04:46.870
- UH, WHERE ARE WE?
- 呃，我们在哪里？

04:46.870 --> 04:50.441
THIS OLD ABANDONED ROAD
IS THE PERFECT VENUE
这条废弃的老路
是完美的场地

04:50.441 --> 04:51.475
FOR YOUR DRIVING TEST.
为了您的驾驶考试。

04:51.475 --> 04:53.644
- DRIVING TEST?
- 驾驶考试？

04:53.644 --> 04:55.011
- THAT'S RIGHT.
- 这是正确的。

04:55.011 --> 04:57.347
NOW YOU'RE FREE FROM
ALL THE DISTRACTING OBSTACLES
现在你摆脱了
所有分散注意力的障碍

04:57.347 --> 04:58.582
ON THE BOATING COURSE.
在划船课程上。

04:58.582 --> 05:00.050
[tires screech]
OUT HERE,
[轮胎尖叫声]
在这里，

05:00.050 --> 05:02.719
THERE'S NOTHING BUT THE ROAD.
除了路，别无他物。

05:02.719 --> 05:05.522
NOW SCOOCH OVER.
现在滚过去。

05:05.522 --> 05:10.293
COME ON,
SCOOCH OVER.
来吧，
滚过去。

05:10.293 --> 05:11.495
- BUT, MRS. PUFF,
WHAT ABOUT THE FACT
- 但是，夫人。噗噗，
事实如何

05:11.495 --> 05:12.763
THAT I'M UNTEACHABLE?
[seat belt clicks]
我是不可教的？
[安全带咔哒声]

05:12.763 --> 05:14.197
- FORGET ALL ABOUT THAT.
- 忘记这一切。

05:14.197 --> 05:17.033
OUT HERE YOU COULD TEACH
A HERMIT CRAB TO BOAT.
在这里你可以教书
寄居蟹上船。

05:17.033 --> 05:19.770
- MRS. PUFF,
I'M STILL INTIMIDATED.
- 太太。噗噗，
我还是很害怕。

05:19.770 --> 05:22.305
- LISTEN, IF YOU'RE NERVOUS
ABOUT BOATING,
- 如果你紧张的话请听
关于划船，

05:22.305 --> 05:27.478
SIMPLY REPEAT THE WORDS
"FOCUS ON THE ROAD.
只需重复这些话
“专注于道路。

05:27.478 --> 05:30.213
THERE IS NOTHING BUT THE ROAD."
除了路，别无他物。”

05:30.213 --> 05:33.049
GOT IT?
- OH, OKAY.
知道了？
- 哦好的。

05:33.049 --> 05:35.819
FOCUS ON THE ROAD.
THERE IS NOTHING BUT THE ROAD.
专注于道路。
除了路，别无他物。

05:35.819 --> 05:38.655
FOCUS ON THE ROAD.
THERE IS NOTHING BUT THE ROAD.
专注于道路。
除了路，别无他物。

05:38.655 --> 05:40.056
[gulps]
[吞咽]

05:40.056 --> 05:42.659
FOCUS ON THE ROAD.
THERE IS NOTHING BUT THE ROAD.
专注于道路。
除了路，别无他物。

05:42.659 --> 05:47.097
FOCUS ON THE ROAD.
THERE IS NOTHING BUT THE ROAD.
专注于道路。
除了路，别无他物。

05:47.097 --> 05:48.732
HEY, LOOK AT ME...
嘿，看着我...

05:48.732 --> 05:50.834
ALL NOT CRASHING AND STUFF.
一切都没有崩溃之类的。

05:50.834 --> 05:51.902
WONDERFUL!
精彩的！

05:51.902 --> 05:53.003
KEEP THAT UP,
继续保持下去，

05:53.003 --> 05:55.639
AND I'LL HAVE NO CHOICE
BUT TO PASS YOU.
我别无选择
但要超越你。

05:55.639 --> 05:57.340
JUST REPEAT YOUR MANTRA.
只需重复您的口头禅即可。

05:57.340 --> 06:00.511
- FOCUS ON THE ROAD--
THE OPEN, UNINTIMIDATING ROAD.
- 专注于道路--
开放、无畏的道路。

06:00.511 --> 06:02.879
- BOATING WITHIN THE LINES--
- 在界限内划船--

06:02.879 --> 06:03.914
WELL DONE.
干得好。

06:03.914 --> 06:06.583
- FOCUS ON THE ROAD.
- 专注于道路。

06:06.583 --> 06:08.118
THERE IS NOTHING BUT THE ROAD.
[tires screech]
除了路，别无他物。
[轮胎尖叫声]

06:08.118 --> 06:10.220
- FINALLY USING
YOUR TURN SIGNAL.
- 最终使用
您的转向灯。

06:10.220 --> 06:11.522
[laughs]
CHECK.
[笑]
检查。

06:11.522 --> 06:13.724
- FOCUS ON THE ROAD.
[tires screech]
- 专注于道路。
[轮胎尖叫声]

06:13.724 --> 06:15.425
THERE IS NOTHING BUT THE ROAD.
除了路，别无他物。

06:15.425 --> 06:17.360
- ROUNDABOUT NAVIGATION--
CHECK.
- 环岛导航--
检查。

06:17.360 --> 06:20.230
- FOCUS ON THE ROAD.
THERE IS NOTHING BUT THE ROAD.
- 专注于道路。
除了路，别无他物。

06:20.230 --> 06:21.932
[engine revs]
[发动机转速]

06:21.932 --> 06:23.399
- SAFE AND STEADY ACCELERATION.
- 安全稳定的加速。

06:23.399 --> 06:24.400
CHECK!
查看！

06:24.400 --> 06:27.871
- FOCUS ON THE ROAD.
- 专注于道路。

06:27.871 --> 06:31.307
THERE IS NOTHING BUT THE ROAD.
除了路，别无他物。

06:34.545 --> 06:35.779
FOCUS ON THE ROAD.
专注于道路。

06:35.779 --> 06:38.782
[tires screeching]
[轮胎的尖叫声]

06:38.782 --> 06:40.884
THERE IS NOTHING BUT THE ROAD.
除了路，别无他物。

06:40.884 --> 06:43.219
[engine revs]
[发动机转速]

06:43.219 --> 06:44.420
FOCUS ON THE ROAD.
专注于道路。

06:44.420 --> 06:46.790
[tires screech]
[轮胎尖叫声]

06:46.790 --> 06:48.592
THERE IS NOTHING BUT THE ROAD.
除了路，别无他物。

06:48.592 --> 06:50.126
FOCUS ON THE ROAD.
专注于道路。

06:50.126 --> 06:51.427
[tires screech]
[轮胎尖叫声]

06:51.427 --> 06:53.396
[echoing]
THERE IS NOTHING BUT THE ROAD.
[回声]
除了路，别无他物。

06:53.396 --> 06:56.232
FOCUS ON THE ROAD.
专注于道路。

06:56.232 --> 06:59.570
THERE IS NOTHING BUT THE ROAD.
除了路，别无他物。

06:59.570 --> 07:00.871
FOCUS ON THE ROAD.
专注于道路。

07:00.871 --> 07:04.975
THERE IS NOTHING BUT THE ROAD.
除了路，别无他物。

07:04.975 --> 07:06.577
FOCUS ON THE ROAD.
专注于道路。

07:06.577 --> 07:09.646
THERE IS NOTHING BUT THE ROAD.
除了路，别无他物。

07:09.646 --> 07:13.483
FOCUS ON THE ROAD.
专注于道路。

07:13.483 --> 07:15.752
THERE IS NOTHING BUT THE ROAD.
除了路，别无他物。

07:15.752 --> 07:18.388
FOCUS ON THE ROAD.
专注于道路。

07:18.388 --> 07:20.423
THERE IS NOTHING BUT THE ROAD.
除了路，别无他物。

07:20.423 --> 07:24.595
- CHECK, CHECK, AND CHECK!
- 检查、检查、检查！

07:24.595 --> 07:25.662
[sighs]
[叹气]

07:25.662 --> 07:28.932
WHAT IS THIS?
这是什么？

07:28.932 --> 07:30.366
ONLY ONE MORE TEST.
只需再进行一次测试。

07:30.366 --> 07:32.803
AND IT'S THE EASIEST ONE YET.
这是迄今为止最简单的一个。

07:32.803 --> 07:35.405
SPONGEBOB, ALL YOU HAVE TO DO
海绵宝宝，你所要做的就是

07:35.405 --> 07:38.775
IS SAFELY DOCK THIS VESSEL.
该船已安全停靠。

07:38.775 --> 07:41.377
- FOCUS ON THE ROAD.
THERE IS NOTHING BUT THE ROAD.
- 专注于道路。
除了路，别无他物。

07:41.377 --> 07:46.216
FOCUS ON THE ROAD.
THERE IS NOTHING BUT THE ROAD.
专注于道路。
除了路，别无他物。

07:46.216 --> 07:49.052
FOCUS ON THE...
ROAD?
专注于...
道路？

07:49.052 --> 07:50.921
WHAT HAPPENED TO THE ROAD?
路上发生了什么？

07:50.921 --> 07:52.288
- CALM DOWN, SPONGEBOB!
- 冷静点，海绵宝宝！

07:52.288 --> 07:56.727
LISTEN! ALL YOU HAVE TO DO
IS SAFELY STOP THIS VESSEL!
听！您所需要做的一切
安全地停住这艘船！

07:56.727 --> 07:59.029
- FOCUS ON THE ROAD!
THERE IS NOTHING BUT THE ROAD!
- 专注于道路！
除了路，别无他物！

07:59.029 --> 08:00.631
- JUST STOP THE BOAT!
- 把船停下来！

08:00.631 --> 08:02.298
- FOCUS ON THE--
DA-DA-DA--
- 专注于——
DA-DA-DA--

08:02.298 --> 08:03.634
THE ROAD!
道路！

08:03.634 --> 08:05.636
- SPONGEBOB, WAIT!
[tires screech]
- 海绵宝宝，等等！
[轮胎尖叫声]

08:05.636 --> 08:08.504
SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝！

08:10.573 --> 08:11.942
- THAT WAS A CLOSE ONE,
MRS. PUFF.
- 那是一场很接近的比赛，
夫人。噗。

08:11.942 --> 08:14.745
BUT I AM BACK ON THE ROAD
AND READY TO FOCUS UPON IT.
但我又上路了
并准备好专注于它。

08:14.745 --> 08:18.314
- SPONGEBOB,
THIS ISN'T JUST ANY ROAD.
- 海绵宝宝，
这不仅仅是一条路。

08:18.314 --> 08:19.850
[truck horn honks]
[卡车喇叭鸣响]

08:19.850 --> 08:21.718
IT'S A TEN-LANE
INTERTIDAL SEAWAY!
这是一条十车道
潮间带航道！

08:21.718 --> 08:24.320
[truck horn honks]
- SUPER-TIDAL INTER--HUH?
[卡车喇叭鸣响]
- 超级潮汐间——嗯？

08:24.320 --> 08:27.023
- STAY CALM, SPONGEBOB.
- 保持冷静，海绵宝宝。

08:27.023 --> 08:29.192
SPONGEBOB.
SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝。
海绵宝宝！

08:30.226 --> 08:32.028
SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝！

08:32.028 --> 08:34.931
REMEMBER YOUR MANTRA!
- RIGHT.
记住你的口头禅！
- 正确的。

08:34.931 --> 08:38.468
FOCUS ON THE ROAD.
THERE IS NOTHING BUT THE--
专注于道路。
除了——之外什么也没有——

08:38.468 --> 08:41.638
[truck horn honks]
I CAN'T EVEN SEE THE ROAD!
[卡车喇叭鸣响]
我什至看不到路！

08:41.638 --> 08:45.141
[teeth chattering]
- SPONGEBOB!
[牙齿打战]
- 海绵宝宝！

08:45.141 --> 08:46.176
[tires screeching]
[轮胎的尖叫声]

08:46.176 --> 08:48.111
GIVE ME THE WHEEL, SPONGEBOB.
把方向盘给我，海绵宝宝。

08:48.111 --> 08:49.112
OH, DEAR.
哦亲爱的。

08:49.112 --> 08:50.847
HE'S COMPLETELY FROZEN UP!
他完全冻僵了！

08:50.847 --> 08:54.084
[truck horn blaring]
[grunts]
[卡车喇叭鸣响]
[咕哝]

08:54.084 --> 08:56.086
FIDDLESTICKS!
小提琴！

08:56.086 --> 08:57.120
[groans]
[呻吟]

08:57.120 --> 08:59.455
[truck horn blaring]
[卡车喇叭鸣响]

08:59.455 --> 09:01.758
NO-HO-HO!
[tires screeching]
不，嗬嗬！
[轮胎的尖叫声]

09:01.758 --> 09:03.426
- RECKLESS DRIVERS.
- 鲁莽的司机。

09:03.426 --> 09:06.730
I LOATHE RECKLESS DRIVERS.
我讨厌鲁莽的司机。

09:06.730 --> 09:09.165
[indistinct
police radio transmission]
[模糊不清
警察无线电传输]

09:09.165 --> 09:13.503
[engine turning, revs]
[发动机转动，转速]

09:13.503 --> 09:15.238
PULL OVER, YOU MENACE.
靠边停车，你这个威胁。

09:15.238 --> 09:17.540
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

09:17.540 --> 09:19.042
[police siren wailing]
[警笛鸣响]

09:19.042 --> 09:21.311
UH, MRS. PUFF,
CAN I HAVE MY ARMS BACK?
呃，夫人。噗噗，
我可以收回我的手臂吗？

09:21.311 --> 09:23.346
- I SAID STOP YOUR VESSEL!
- OOH!
- 我说停下你的船！
- 哦！

09:23.346 --> 09:24.748
- SORRY, MR. OFFICER, SIR!
- 对不起，先生。 OFFICER, SIR!

09:24.748 --> 09:26.482
I'M APPLYING THE BRAKES!
我正在踩刹车！

09:26.482 --> 09:27.751
[engine revs]
OH!
[发动机转速]
哦！

09:27.751 --> 09:31.021
- AH, WE'VE GOT US A RUNNER.
[engine revs]
- 啊，我们有一个跑步者。
[发动机转速]

09:31.021 --> 09:32.522
- PULL OVER, SPONGEBOB!
- 靠边停车，海绵宝宝！

09:32.522 --> 09:33.990
AND MAKE IT QUICK.
并加快速度。

09:33.990 --> 09:37.027
LOOK!
看！

09:37.027 --> 09:39.029
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

09:39.029 --> 09:41.197
[tires screech]
- NO!
[轮胎尖叫声]
- 不！

09:41.197 --> 09:42.532
[crash]
[碰撞]

09:42.532 --> 09:44.600
OH!
哦！

09:44.600 --> 09:47.103
[tires screeching]
WHOA!
[轮胎的尖叫声]
哇啊！

09:47.103 --> 09:49.740
[tires screeching]
[轮胎的尖叫声]

09:49.740 --> 09:53.643
[shrieks]
[尖叫声]

09:53.643 --> 09:54.811
[tires screeching]
SPONGEBOB!
[轮胎的尖叫声]
海绵宝宝！

09:54.811 --> 09:56.579
HIT THE BRAKES!
踩刹车！

09:56.579 --> 09:58.448
- HUH? OH! OKAY.
- 嗯？哦！好的。

09:58.448 --> 10:01.752
[tires screeching]
[轮胎的尖叫声]

10:05.756 --> 10:08.091
- GOODNESS GRACIOUS.
- 仁慈的上帝。

10:08.091 --> 10:11.094
THERE ISN'T A SCRATCH
ON THIS VESSEL.
没有划痕
在这艘船上。

10:11.094 --> 10:14.765
SPONGEBOB, THE TEST IS HISTORY.
海绵宝宝，考验就是历史。

10:14.765 --> 10:17.333
YOU--YOU'VE PASSED!
你——你已经通过了！

10:17.333 --> 10:21.872
HERE'S YOUR LICENSE!
这是您的许可证！

10:21.872 --> 10:24.540
AND I'M FREE!
[engine humming]
我有空了！
[发动机嗡嗡声]

10:24.540 --> 10:25.608
HA HA!
哈哈！

10:25.608 --> 10:27.043
[tires screech]
[轮胎尖叫声]

10:27.043 --> 10:28.678
[indistinct
police radio transmission]
[模糊不清
警察无线电传输]

10:28.678 --> 10:30.213
- I DON'T THINK SO.
- 我不这么认为。

10:30.213 --> 10:32.482
- IS THERE A PROBLEM,
OFFICER?
- 有问题吗？
军官？

10:32.482 --> 10:35.251
[beeping]
[嘟嘟声]

10:35.251 --> 10:37.587
- WELL, YOU CROSSED
THE COUNTY LINE
- 好吧，你穿越了
县线

10:37.587 --> 10:38.855
THREE MILES BACK.
三英里后。

10:38.855 --> 10:41.191
YOU, MA'AM,
ARE A PAROLE VIOLATOR,
您，女士，
是假释违规者，

10:41.191 --> 10:45.495
WHICH MAKES THIS TEST
NULL AND VOID.
这使得这个测试
无效和无效。

10:45.495 --> 10:49.332
I'LL TAKE THAT.
我会接受的。

10:51.434 --> 10:55.138
- SPONGEBOB,
I'LL GET YOU FOR THIS!
- 海绵宝宝，
我会抓住你的！

10:55.138 --> 10:57.040
I'LL GET YOU!
我会抓住你的！

我会抓住你的！